{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方两行大号白色标题，随后下方紫色放大的“少露些心意，会不会少疼些？”和“藏回去更难受”吸引视线。上下两块都很醒目，主视线有竞争。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不完全确定。能大致看出是在一段关系中担心感情能否一直维持，但具体处境没有第一眼直接抓清。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、患得患失、害怕受伤；能感受到矛盾，但情绪的具体来源不够直接。\",\n  \"missed\": \"起初害怕自己的需要成为对方的负担，如今更害怕对方不再需要自己；明明真心想对对方好，却发现藏起心意反而更难受。以及想获得长久承诺、相处时间飞快带来的不安。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方大标题与下方大号粗体文字都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上方标题和下方文字中，需要拼接才能理解完整处境及感受之间的关系。\",\n    \"上方标题本身较长，需要读完整句才能明确人物的处境和疑虑。\",\n    \"下方单块包含多层转折，怕成为负担、怕不再被需要、想隐藏心意、隐藏后更难受，需要顺着文字理解。\",\n    \"中间灰色正文连续堆叠多行，重要的情绪变化和具体细节藏在其中，快速扫视不容易拿到。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f91783f3-d03d-470a-a00a-04036e966862", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T021911944358Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.86, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:19:45.793225+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5d278692d81b58a77b2083a4781ed83a5f47228a92f068848917aae423df4689", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f